How about checking the deadline of the passed in ctx:
```
	if deadline, hasDeadline := ctx.Deadline(); hasDeadline {
		// compute the timeout
		if timeout := time.Until(deadline); timeout > time.Hour {
			_, cancel := cloud.ContextWithCallTimeout()
			defer cancel()
		}
	}
```
If the timeout is longer than what cloud.ContextWithCallTimeout expects, create context with 1 hour timeout.
